Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.38,0:22:45.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H164A6F&\c&H164A6F&}尋找著存在的意義  獨自陷入沉思
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.39,0:22:50.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H164A6F&\c&H164A6F&}在這世界迎來終結之前
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H164A6F&\c&H164A6F&}我必須快點找到你才行
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.85,0:22:59.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}通往那勉強維繫的明天  還請一定要跨越過去啊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.53,0:23:02.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}那怠惰的祈願
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.90,0:23:04.70,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}就連信心都沒有
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.70,0:23:06.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}也不需要一決勝負
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.53,0:23:08.70,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}把電源徹底關掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}明天還要早起
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.16,0:23:11.87,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}卻因胡思亂想無法入眠
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.87,0:23:14.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}嗯  向今天道一聲再見
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.00,0:23:19.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}我愛著你  那一聲呼喚
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.25,0:23:22.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}猶如潮汐周而復始  愈發令人心生憐愛
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.76,0:23:26.30,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}宛如施展了魔法一般  令我不禁再次回想起
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.30,0:23:31.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}那旅途中久違的溫暖
